  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">이런 생각이 들었습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">시금치 잎을 물에 넣어서 광합성 실험하는 걸 봤으면서, 어째서 BTB 실험은 물풀이 필수라고 생각하는 걸까?</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">네~ 모두가 광합성, BTB 하면 떠올리는 이미지(시험관대, 시험관, 물풀, 호일..) 때문이었습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">그냥 화단에 있는 잎이 통통한 아무 잎이나 따서 해봐도 될 것 같아서 해봤습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">결과는?? 됩니다^^</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">확인차 해본 실험이라 잎을 가위로 막 잘라 넣어서 정량적이지 않아요. 일단 그냥 되는 것만 확인요~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c0dfff2f614062e3e3ca748b5d72b58e3da71f6f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c0dfff2f614062e3e3ca748b5d72b58e3da71f6f\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a03ca850d873056c0daa9a5d23a1668254b53b3d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a03ca850d873056c0daa9a5d23a1668254b53b3d\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/51b2e9a44f9c8a1d19206fd3124f878cf9f751ce\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/51b2e9a44f9c8a1d19206fd3124f878cf9f751ce\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/525111d02c2154a9c0a0fbb6db23934cf626a